cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Hephaestus in your research, cite it as shown below.
type: software
title: Hephaestus
abstract: >-
  Hephaestus is an open-source AI mentor that helps software developers grow in the engineering
  practices their team values. It reads pull requests, merge requests, issues and reviews, and
  checks them against the practices that the team chose. If a review finds a problem it can
  support, Hephaestus can show the evidence and suggest a next step. Developers can ask about
  the feedback in a conversation.
authors:
  - name: TUM Applied Education Technologies
    website: https://aet.cit.tum.de/
repository-code: https://github.com/hephaestus-build/Hephaestus
url: https://hephaestus.build
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ai-mentor
  - practice-feedback
  - engineering-practices
  - developer-feedback
  - self-hosted
